  "检测到含旧版均线设置（显示均线/均线周期）的卡片，请到 设置 → 路径设置 → 清理维护 运行「升级均线指标」。":
    "Cards with legacy MA settings (显示均线/均线周期) detected — run \"Upgrade MA Indicators\" under Settings → Paths → Maintenance.",
  "YAML 无法解析，已原样保留": "YAML could not be parsed; left unchanged",
  "均线值无法解析（应为逗号分隔的正整数列表）": "The MA value could not be parsed (expected a comma-separated list of positive integers)",
  "⚠ 本库可能仍存在旧格式（均线/显示均线）的卡片设置——旧键已不再生效，请运行下方「升级均线指标」。":
    "⚠ This vault may still contain legacy (均线/显示均线) card settings — the old keys no longer take effect. Run \"Upgrade MA Indicators\" below.",
  "升级均线指标": "Upgrade MA Indicators",
  "把资产卡 YAML 里的旧均线设置（均线 / 显示均线）批量改写为统一的 indicators 指标列表：均线周期列表转为对应数量的 ma 指标，显示均线: false 转为空指标列表，显示均线: true 直接删键（跟随全局默认）。无法解析的卡片不会改动，会在报告中列出。":
    "Batch-rewrite the legacy MA settings (均线 / 显示均线) in quote-card YAML into the unified indicators list: a MA period list becomes that many ma indicators, 显示均线: false becomes an empty indicator list, and 显示均线: true simply drops the key (following the global default). Cards that fail to parse are left unchanged and listed in the report.",
  "检查失效指标引用": "Check Stale Indicator References",
